#==============================================================================================
#
#   grid_formatting_context_7 - Layout::GridFormattingContext: the items' size contributions
#                               and automatic minimum sizes
#
#   DESCRIPTION:
#       Port of LibWeb/Layout/GridFormattingContext.cpp (lines 2464-2850): the grid container's
#       maximum size, the items' min- and max-content sizes and contributions, their
#       containing block (the sum of the tracks and gaps they span), the limited contributions
#       of items under fixed max track sizing functions
#       (https://drafts.csswg.org/css-grid-2/#algo-spanning-items), the specified,
#       transferred and content size suggestions, the content-based minimum size
#       (https://www.w3.org/TR/css-grid-1/#content-based-minimum-size), the automatic minimum
#       size, the minimum contribution, and the static position rectangle of an absolutely
#       positioned child.
